cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this database, please cite it as below."
title: "Submarine Volcano Activity Database"
type: dataset
authors:
  - family-names: Ikegami
    given-names: Fumihiko
    affiliation: Ikegami GeoResearch
    email: f.ikegami@gmail.com
url: "https://geoign.github.io/submarine-volcano-activity/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/geoign/submarine-volcano-activity"
license: CC-BY-4.0
date-released: "2026-11-14"
abstract: >-
  A satellite record of shallow submarine volcanoes worldwide since 2013: discoloured water,
  floating pumice, new land, thermal anomalies and bands in the air seen in Sentinel-2, Landsat
  and low-resolution imagery, with the review of every detection.
keywords:
  - submarine volcano
  - discoloured water
  - pumice raft
  - Sentinel-2
  - Landsat
  - remote sensing
